    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After a dramatic poolside confrontation, François confessed his childhood fear of drowning, and Christophe embraced him in the water. Meanwhile, Colette caught a drunken Andréa kissing another woman at the party and walked away in heartbreak. Feeling guilty about Sofia's ruined callback, Gabriel visits Sofia at her apartment to apologize. Later that night, a panicked visitor knocks at Gabriel's own door. Listen to the scene in French first. Don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "sofia",
      "t": "Oui?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Sofia? Excuse-moi, je te dérange?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
